## 🎯 What is J-ROC OS?

A complete operating system for autonomous business operation. Deploy AI agents to:
- Close revenue autonomously (SDRs, Setters)
- Run support 24/7 (Support Agents)
- Maintain quality (QA Managers)
- Generate insights (Reporting Analysts)
- Coordinate everything (JROC Commander)

**Current State:** Core infrastructure complete, autonomous revenue engine functional, AI employee system in development.

