## 📊 Commander Orchestration

### Monitor & Control All Agents

```typescript
import { Commander } from '@jroc-os/commander';

const commander = new Commander();

// Check agent status
const agentStatus = await commander.getAgentStatus('sdr-agent');
console.log({
  agentId: agentStatus.id,
  status: agentStatus.status, // 'running' | 'paused' | 'error'
  tasksCompleted: agentStatus.tasksCompleted,
  uptime: agentStatus.uptime,
  memory: agentStatus.memory,
});

// Scale agent
await commander.scaleAgent('sdr-agent', {
  instances: 5, // Run 5 parallel instances
  concurrency: 10, // Each handles 10 tasks
});

// View agent metrics
const metrics = await commander.getAgentMetrics('sdr-agent', {
  period: '7d',
  metrics: ['task_completion', 'error_rate', 'latency'],
});

// Broadcast command to all agents
await commander.broadcast({
  command: 'update_knowledge',
  data: { competitorInfo: [...] },
});

// Get system health
const systemHealth = await commander.getSystemHealth();
console.log({
  agentsRunning: systemHealth.agentsRunning,
  tasksQueued: systemHealth.tasksQueued,
  totalThroughput: systemHealth.totalThroughput,
  cpuUsage: systemHealth.cpuUsage,
  memoryUsage: systemHealth.memoryUsage,
});
```

